  "description": "Observability dashboard for the CardDemo Java (Spring Boot) application migrated from the AWS CardDemo COBOL mainframe workload. Visualises HTTP traffic, latency, batch pipeline throughput, authentication, and JVM/GC metrics scraped by Prometheus from /actuator/prometheus.",
